        "Content": "<ul><li> Quiet setting at the end of a mature cul-de-sac</li><li> Ideal family surroundings in highly regarded Churchtown</li><li> Presented in turnkey condition</li><li> Three-bedroom semi-detached family home</li><li> Approximately 115 sq m of residential accommodation</li><li> Approximately 134 sq m in total including the integral garage</li><li> Private rear garden extending to approximately 80 feet</li><li> West-facing rear orientation</li><li> Professionally redesigned garden and raised patio beds</li><li> Off-street parking to the front</li><li> Extensive renovation and extension completed in 2012</li><li> New windows, pipework, electrical cabling and water storage installed in 2012</li><li> Cat 5e cabling provided in every room</li><li> Garden shed added circa 2015</li><li> Upstairs bathroom and downstairs WC fully renovated in 2020</li><li> C1 Building Energy Rating</li><li> Insulated</li><li> Renovated fireplaces</ul>"
